DATASET RECORD LICENSES

Each JSONL record's license field identifies the license assigned to the original editorial material in that record, to the extent the licensor has rights to license it. Existing source files may carry an explicit CC BY 4.0 notice because that material was previously distributed under that license. New source files default to CC BY-NC 4.0 unless a different license notice applies. The dataset manifest lists the licenses represented in the current export. A record's license does not grant rights in facts as such or in third-party materials.

